      "content": "exactly, it's like they're trying to bleed me dry slowly so i just give up and close the account. it feels like a liquidation process. if i try to move money or change how i'm using the account they just hit me with another fee. what kind of defensive maneuvers can i take to protect my funds? i need to stop them from completing this while i figure out how to move everything without triggering more red flags.",
